{
  "_readme": [
    "NEWBURYPORT'S ROADS IN THE BUILDINGS' TREE (docs/ROADS.md): the OSM highway ways of the",
    "roads harvest (harvester/cpp/planet_roads) filed as ribbons beside the building solids in one",
    "folded tree, each riding the composed ground, as wide as its file says or the layer's declared",
    "laneWidth x lanes. Tunnels are not drawn; bridges stand on the ground until the clearance",
    "surveys give them a deck.",
    "",
    "Build the tree first (a box about the town, a minute):",
    "  build/bin/gagame.exe scenes/demos/newburyport_roads.json --tool building-lod:-70.95,42.77,-70.80,42.87",
    "then launch:  build/bin/gagame.exe scenes/demos/newburyport_roads.json",
    "FLY: W A S D move, Q / E down / up, hold the right mouse button to look."
  ],
